<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Guinness 1996 net up 10.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Guinness 1996 net up 10.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		     92.23	 vs	  83.43</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	    30.5	  vs	  27.6</p>
<p>    Turnover			685.24	 vs	 641.21</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		126.33	 vs	 116.05</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)	    26.0	  vs	  64.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Guinness Anchor Bhd is involved in the production and marketing of alcoholic beverages.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
